30
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:39,500
This small collection does not establish general
superiority.

31
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,394
Anyone can inspect the public recorded explorer,
select conditions, compare methods, and scrub

32
00:02:45,394 --> 00:02:50,787
